      "y": 665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "4",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 研究价值\n- 和现有 Wiki/10-股票投资/01-Cubox资料流/主题资料总结/行业/AI算力链/2026-05-15 - AI算…\n- 适合用于补充 Rubin 相比 GB200/GB300 可能带来的新增环节：CPO、外置光源、空芯光纤、TGV/玻璃基板、…",
      "x": -720,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
